          "content": "===METIS-DATA-BOUNDARY=== BEGIN PROJECT ===METIS-DATA-BOUNDARY===\\nname: Metis\\ndescription: A test project\\n===METIS-DATA-BOUNDARY=== END PROJECT ===METIS-DATA-BOUNDARY===\\n\\n===METIS-DATA-BOUNDARY=== BEGIN REQUIREMENT REQ-001 ===METIS-DATA-BOUNDARY===\\ntext: Export every customer's order history as a CSV.\\nevidence:\\n[1] documentId=doc_1 chunk=0 file=brief.md\\nBrief: Export every customer's order history as\\n===METIS-DATA-BOUNDARY=== END REQUIREMENT REQ-001 ===METIS-DATA-BOUNDARY===\\n\\n===METIS-DATA-BOUNDARY=== BEGIN REQUIREMENT REQ-002 ===METIS-DATA-BOUNDARY===\\ntext: Remove the legacy coupon screen.\\nevidence:\\n[1] documentId=doc_1 chunk=0 file=brief.md\\nBrief: Remove the legacy coupon screen.\\n===METIS-DATA-BOUNDARY=== END REQUIREMENT REQ-002 ===METIS-DATA-BOUNDARY===\\n\\n\\n\\n\\nProduce findings JSON now, one or more per requirement, each with its requirementId."
